- vertex at 25% from bottom: above_total = 0.75*span.
- branch exit at 90% of the distance from vertex to top: above_exit = 0.9*above_total = 0.675*span. Then curve exits at y = k+0.675span, 0.075span below top. Good margin 10% of above_total. Curve still nearly reaches top.

